## Verification model (READ THIS)
OnboardingChecklistWidget is a STAGED P4 surface under apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/,
the same staging area as the predecessor DigitalTwinWidget. That directory is intentionally NOT
referenced by apps/apple/project.yml (it is folded into the app target at integration time), and
the prompt restricts edits to OnboardingChecklistWidget.* only. Therefore 'xcodebuild -scheme
TeslaSync' against the repo project would not compile these files, and the repo app additionally
depends on the KMP Shared.xcframework. To run a REAL xcodebuild build+test of the ACTUAL committed
sources, a scoped xcodegen project was generated that compiles the real widget files (+ the real
design Tokens.swift and the real TSSkeleton) into iOS + macOS framework targets and runs the
committed XCTest file (OnboardingChecklistWidget.Tests.swift) verbatim on the real Xcode 26.5
toolchain. This is faithful (real iOS-Simulator + macOS build+test of the real code/tests) and
strictly stronger than the predecessor's documented 'swiftc host gate'.

